# Files and directories under docs/ that must never be published.
#
# This file is what makes "Mintlify reads the private repo's docs/ directory"
# a safe setup: .mintignore removes matching files from the build completely
# (they are not published, not indexed, and not reachable by URL), unlike
# hidden pages which stay accessible.
#
# IMPORTANT — every pattern below is anchored with a leading slash, because an
# unanchored `architecture/` would match `en/architecture/` and `zh/architecture/`
# too. Those two ARE published pages. Anchoring keeps exclusion to the docs root.

# Internal engineering and strategy notes (never user-facing).
/architecture/
/contracts/
/product-strategy/

# Diagrams generated for the internal architecture deep-dive docs. The published
# pages only reference the locale-prefixed `en-*` / `zh-*` diagrams, so the
# deep-dive series is excluded here to keep internal system diagrams off the
# public site.
/generated/mermaid/architecture-deep-dive-*

# Internal screenshot production spec. It states "本文件供截图制作参考，不面向用户"
# and was deliberately removed from the public docs site, so it must stay
# excluded when Mintlify reads this directory directly — otherwise it would be
# published again by accident.
/zh/product/seedance-ecommerce-guide-screenshot-spec.md
